[I] Fast, whole-buffer DEFLATE-based compression and decompression

[T] libdeflate is heavily optimized. It is significantly faster than the zlib
[T] library, both for compression and decompression, and especially on x86
[T] processors. In addition, libdeflate provides optional high compression
[T] modes that provide a better compression ratio than the zlib's "level 9".

[U] https://github.com/ebiggers/libdeflate

[A] Eric Biggers
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/library
[F] CROSS

[L] OpenSource
